.TH SDL_SetEventEnabled 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_SetEventEnabled \- Set the state of processing events by type.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_events.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_SetEventEnabled(Uint32 type, bool enabled);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I type
the type of event; see
.BR SDL_EventType
for details\[char46]
.TP
.I enabled
whether to process the event or not\[char46]
.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

